/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 118 0 R
/E (The SQL query that application programmers/users write may be very inefficient if executed exactly as it is by the database management system. The query may takes a long time to process in its original form and/or consume too much system resources. This is a serious cause of concern as the database management system is expected to answer a lot of queries simultaneously and fast.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [2]
>>
